	<div class="articleHeader recipeHeader">
				<h1 data-rtype="1">Lemon Meringue Tartlets</h1>
					<p class="by">By <a href="#" data-href="/zrzore-4496-syhgrynu.ugz" class="nofollowLink"><span itemprop="author">flutelah</span></a></p>
				<span id="favouritePlaceholder"></span>
					<p data-rtype="2" itemprop="about">The delicate shortbread crust plays well with the rich, zesty lemon cream and the sweet, airy meringue to top. The three simple elements marry each other well and promise a satisfying french twist to the American standard!</p>
			</div>
	<meta itemprop="keywords" content="merringue, butter tart pastries, soft meringue, lemon meringue tartlet, bake, French pastries, baking, French tart, meringue, French desserts, pie, tart, French recipes for kids, dessert, lemon, lemon meringue,  tartlet"/>
